## AI-Assisted

## Install diffoscope and the format-descent helpers the reproducibility lane
## (.github/workflows/local-reproducible.yml) needs to compare two build images.
## Kept as a ci/ script (github-actions-security.md rule 7) so this post-checkout
## shell is shellcheck / 'bash -n' covered and runnable locally, rather than an
## inline workflow 'run:' block.
##
## diffoscope comes from trixie-backports, not trixie: trixie ships 297, which
## OOMs when diffing a large DIFFERING member of two multi-GB images, whereas
## backports (>= 302, currently 306) has the streaming fix. Identical images
## short-circuit either way, but a real difference must produce a report, not an
## OOM. trixie-backports is enabled below and diffoscope pulled from it with
## '-t'; the descenders resolve from trixie as normal (they have no backports
## candidate, so '-t' does not disturb them).
##
## --no-install-recommends keeps diffoscope's large optional recommends (LaTeX
## and friends) out; the descenders the lane's images actually need are named
## explicitly: ISO 9660 (genisoimage), squashfs (squashfs-tools), tar/OVA
## (built-in), qcow2 / vmdk / vdi (qemu-utils' qemu-img), 7z containers
## (p7zip-full), raw hexdump (xxd), and fakeroot so squashfs/device nodes and
## ownership compare fully. reproducible-compare only WARNs on a missing
## descender, so an unlisted format degrades gracefully.

set -o errexit
set -o nounset
set -o pipefail
set -o errtrace
shopt -s inherit_errexit
shopt -s shift_verbose

true "INFO: Currently running script: ${BASH_SOURCE[0]} $*"

## Enable trixie-backports (deb822) so diffoscope can be pulled from it. The
## container is plain trixie; a single-suite drop-in is enough and leaves the
## build's own sources untouched.
printf '%s\n' \
   'Types: deb' \
   'URIs: http://deb.debian.org/debian' \
   'Suites: trixie-backports' \
   'Components: main' \
   'Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg' \
   | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/trixie-backports.sources >/dev/null

sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install --yes --no-install-recommends -t trixie-backports \
   diffoscope \
   genisoimage \
   squashfs-tools \
   fakeroot \
   xxd \
   p7zip-full \
   qemu-utils
